.TH "YAMLR" "1" "November 2026" "Yamlr Manual" "User Commands"
\fBKubernetes Configuration Safety Engine\fR
.PP
Yamlr is a deterministic Kubernetes configuration resolution plane built in native Rust with embedded OpenAPI schemas and offline execution.
.PP
.SS "🌗 Tier Architecture"
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **Individual Tier (Free & Open Community):** Unlimited, 100% offline manifest scanning (\fByamlr scan\fR), autonomous healing (\fByamlr heal\fR), canonical formatting (\fByamlr fmt\fR), instant repair (\fByamlr fix\fR), and standard SARIF report generation.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **Team Tier:** Adds multi-repository GitOps fleet reconciliation (\fByamlr fleet\fR), PR automation, and custom ValidatingAdmissionPolicy export (\fByamlr vap\fR).
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **Enterprise Tier:** Adds cryptographic compliance evidence bundles (\fByamlr evidence\fR), HMAC-SHA256 manifest signing and verification (\fByamlr sign\fR, \fByamlr verify\fR), air-gapped offline distribution, and OpenTelemetry exposition (\fB--otel\fR).
> [!IMPORTANT]
.PP
> \fBAudit mode (\fByamlr scan\fR) never modifies files. Active Healing (\fByamlr heal\fR) only changes manifests when explicitly invoked and backed by Global Atomic Sessions and automatic backups.\fR
.PP
Runs 100% locally. No data leaves your machine.
.PP
